            <string>Voxels in the noise mask are set to zero velocity. Magnitude threshold: magnitude below the noise magnitude threshold. Magnitude and velocity noise (slicerheart_4dflow, Bock 2007): low time-averaged magnitude (Otsu threshold) or random phase (very high temporal velocity variation).</string>
